      "name_en": "Flexible Reinforcement Budget",
      "icon": "./assets/boosters/Flexible_Reinforcement_Budget_Booster_Icon.svg",
      "warbond": "Steeled Veterans",
      "warbond_zh": "铁血老兵",
      "warbond_page": 3,
      "warbond_color": "#D6806D",
      "price": 75,
      "price_zh": "勋章 ×75",
      "description": "Reduce time until new reinforcements are granted once they've been depleted.",
      "description_zh": "增援次数耗尽后，缩短新一批增援发放的等待时间。",
      "overview_zh": "装备后，获得增援的计时会缩短；该效果仅在增援次数已经耗尽时激活。",
      "sections": [
        {
